==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|заня́тіе||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
{{deverbal|ru|заня́ть}}, probably {{clq|ru|fr|occupation|nocap=1}}. Cf. {{cog|pl|zajęcie}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|заня́тие|pos=n}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-занятие.ogg}}

===Noun===
{{ru-noun+|заня́тие}}

# [[occupation]], [[work]], [[business]] (activity or task with which one occupies oneself)
#: {{syn|ru|де́ятельность|де́ло|времяпрепровожде́ние}}
# [[exercise]]
# [[lesson]], [[lecture]]
#: {{syn|ru|урок|час|класс}}
# {{lb|ru|military}} [[capture]]
#: {{syn|ru|взя́тие|оккупа́ция|захва́т}}

